<title>JAPAN: Mazda - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Mazda - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		669.79		vs	  685.20</p>
<p> Operating    loss 12.67		vs    loss 18.24</p>
<p> Current	 prft 2.08		vs    loss 17.21</p>
<p> Net		prft 179 million    vs    loss 18.29</p>
<p> EPS	     prft 0.15 yen	  vs    loss 16.96 yen</p>
<p> Shares	   1.22 billion	  vs	1.08 billion</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Mazda Motor Corp is a leading car manufacturer.</p>
